sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK as SDK
    participant Main as Main model
    participant Hard as Hard condenser
    SDK->>Main: Request with active context
    Main-->>SDK: Context-window error
    Note over SDK: Protect pending user input
    SDK->>Hard: Summarize eligible active history
    Note over Hard: Bounded retries with shorter previews
    Hard-->>SDK: Summary
    Note over SDK: Save summary and commit reset
    SDK->>Main: Emergency notice + summary + pending input
    Main-->>SDK: Continue the user's work
